# What is derived, and therefore not committed.
#
# The rule here is that anything `make all` can rebuild from seed 4471 is left
# out, and anything a reader would want to check without running the chain is
# kept. So the corpus CSVs stay, because a judge should be able to look at a row
# of the record this project argues about, and every report stays, because every
# figure in the README and in the docs is quoted from one.

# ---- dependencies ----------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
web/node_modules/

# ---- build output ----------------------------------------------------------
web/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# ---- engine build artefacts ------------------------------------------------
# Built by `make db` from data/schema/ksp_schema.sql and the corpus CSVs. It is
# 5.8 MB and reproducible in seconds, so it is not worth a place in history.
data/corpus/sutra.db

# ---- study scratch directories ---------------------------------------------
# Each of these holds one or more whole corpora generated for a single sweep.
# scripts/layer6_selection_study.py and scripts/gender_noise_study.py rebuild
# them on demand, and their findings live in the JSON reports which are kept.
data/corpus_layer6/
data/corpus_gender/
data/corpus_vocab/
data/corpus_scale/

# ---- the deploy bundle -----------------------------------------------------
# `make package` writes catalyst/sutra.zip. It is a build output, it is 900 KB,
# and it changes on every build. docs/deploy.md says how to produce and upload
# one, which is more useful in a repository than the artefact itself.
catalyst/

# ---- benchmark run output --------------------------------------------------
# The task, the gold set and the scorer are committed. What a submission
# produces is not.
benchmark/baseline_output.csv
benchmark/sutra_output.csv

# ---- editor and OS ---------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
